</li>
<li>
<p>understand risk-free assets;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize Sharpe ratios;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>understand market and idiosyncratic risk conceptually;</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>recognize factor models;</p>
</li>
<li>
